{"id":"b82b758f400b1bec","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-orey-sentence.md","title":"Orey Sentence","display":"df-orey-sentence — Orey Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-orey-sentence","aliases":["67-df-orey-sentence"],"display":"df-orey-sentence — Orey Sentence","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-interpretability]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 10 后定义，印刷页 82；PDF 第 93 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-orey-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-orey-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orey-sentence — Orey Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 10 后定义，印刷页 82；PDF 第 93 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</li>\n<li>本原子中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\sigma\">\\(T+\\sigma\\)</span> 只是公理集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\">\\(T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\)</span> 的短写，不要求演绎封闭。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma)\\)</span> 在下式定义；一致性不是定义的一部分，相关独立性命题另加一致性假设。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\neg\\sigma\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\neg\\sigma\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书称两侧扩张都可解释于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的句子为 Orey 句。定义不自行保证存在；原书 Theorem 10 在其一致、原始递归 PA 扩张背景下给出带回避条件的存在结论。</p>\n<p>修订去掉不必要的演绎闭包，与原书“理论是公理集”的约定一致。来源定义陈述已核对。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Theorem 10 后定义，印刷页 82；PDF 第 93 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集，$\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\neg\\sigma\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1570,"backlinks":[{"id":"16686ac2c7343b20","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orey}_T$ 取 [[67-df-orey-sentence]]；外部一致性谓词 $\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 取 [[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-orey-sentence]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-orey-sentence]]"}],"outgoing":["854772391cef4007","44cd21d3d12e4d8d"]}